{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600160","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1360016001:2":{"text":"\"어둠 추격\" 당일 밤, 우리는 듀라의 여신상 아래에 모여 성석 마을의 주민들과 함께 \"빛의 도래\"가 오기를 기다렸다.","source_cn":"“逐夜”当晚，你们齐聚一堂，在女神像下，与圣石镇的居民...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5F5D17C430CF99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360016002:0":{"text":"자네들과 엇갈리는 줄 알았네, 친구들.","source_cn":"还以为会错过你们呢，老朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82EFB2D285FDD100","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360016003:1":{"text":"마스터를 잘 아시잖아요, 장군님! 어떤 축제든 <male>그</male><female>그녀</female>는 반드시 돌아올 거라는 걸요!","source_cn":"你还不了解主人吗，将军！无论什么节日，<male>他<...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CB7E718163F8A3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터를 잘 아시잖아요, 장군님! 어떤 축제든 <male>그</male><female>그녀</female>는 반드시 돌아올 거라는 걸요!","female":"마스터를 잘 아시잖아요, 장군님! 어떤 축제든 <male>그</male><female>그녀</female>는 반드시 돌아올 거라는 걸요!","variant_male_record_index":"153094","variant_female_record_index":"153095","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360016004:1":{"text":"게다가 저희를 위해 항상 새로운 친구들을 데리고 오시고요. 하하하.","source_cn":"而且还经常会为我们带来一些新朋友，哈哈哈哈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8198AF75D70D3569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360016005:0":{"text":"전 이미 모두에게 새벽의 불꽃을 가져다줄 준비가 되었어요.","source_cn":"我已经准备好给大家带来晨曦的焰光了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x172C88D4EAD7AABC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360016006:1":{"text":"아, 시간이 다 되었어요! 여러분, 카운트다운 준비!","source_cn":"啊，快到时间了！大家，准备倒计时！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9388F46C9532700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360016007:0":{"text":"5, 4, 3, 2, 1...","source_cn":"5、4、3、2、1——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7B130A31AF1B8CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1360016008:1":{"text":"카운트다운이 끝난 순간, 눈부시게 아름다운 빛 한 줄기가 탈렌의 앞을 스쳐 그녀보다 먼저 하늘을 갈랐다.","source_cn":"在倒计时结束的瞬间，一道绚丽无比的流光居然抢在塔琳之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9059BD57D27B5229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1360016009:1":{"text":"저건 샤키탈리스의 창?! 선수를 빼앗기다니! 나서기 좋아하는 녀석!","source_cn":"那是萨基塔里斯的长矛？！居然被他抢先了！那个爱出风头的家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x447311768B16E4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360016010:1":{"text":"탈렌 또한 지지 않겠다는 듯, 비할 데 없이 아름답고 화려한 화염을 하늘로 올려보냈다...","source_cn":"塔琳不甘示弱，下一秒，无比鲜艳的华美火焰盘旋破空而上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885E967729B9DF8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1360016011:1":{"text":"곧이어, 모두의 환호 속에 폭죽이 아릅답게 터졌다...","source_cn":"随即，在大家的欢呼声中，烟火燃起——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB27CA99E2C848E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1360016012:0":{"text":"빛의 도래 시간이군!","source_cn":"开阳之时，到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD86A123D7D38EA53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1360016013:1":{"text":"하하하하, 내 폭죽은 역시 달라!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，我的大烟花就是不一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x820CB2B13A90F1E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1360016014:1":{"text":"즐거운 봄빛 축제 되세요, 후긴님!","source_cn":"春焰庆快乐啊，呼金大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF29879A14CBAA1AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1360016015:1":{"text":"불을 켜고 빛의 도래를 축하하자꾸나!","source_cn":"点起灯来，庆祝开阳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x857DD80CA3C0A11A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1360016016:1":{"text":"봄빛 축제가 시작되었어요!","source_cn":"春焰庆开始了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1B12844231D757F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1360016017:0":{"text":"즐겁고 행복한 봄빛 축제 되렴, 얘들아!","source_cn":"春焰庆快乐！孩子们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D76E5ADAE01FAA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1360016018:1":{"text":"올해의 폭죽은 정말 색다르군.","source_cn":"今年的烟花真是与众不同啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4916DAC29080661","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1360016019:0":{"text":"이 멍청이들아, 멍하니 있지 말고 계속 싸워!","source_cn":"别愣着，你们这帮笨蛋，继续上啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E499DEBB4929D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1360016020:1":{"text":"지금 블랙하울 부족의 전사들이 잠시 열세에 처했습니다.","source_cn":"现在黑嚎部族的战士暂时处于劣势——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33FD954BC7386A30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1360016021:1":{"text":"예쁘다, 루몬트는 그림을 많이 그릴 거예요!","source_cn":"好漂亮，噜噜要画好多画！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05553E6839B10B6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1360016022:1":{"text":"헤헤, 예쁘지? 이번 폭죽엔 내 공도 있다고!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，好看吧？这次的烟火可有我的功劳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E5A63F99A82E425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1360016023:1":{"text":"흥, 꽤 볼만 한데. 테미히아 그 녀석은 지금 뭘 하고 있을지...","source_cn":"哼，还挺漂亮的嘛，不知道特弥希娅那家伙现在在干什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6316A965FB6E8E2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1360016024:1":{"text":"할아버지, 할머니, 폭죽이에요, 어서 나와보세요!","source_cn":"爷爷，奶奶，放烟花了，快出来看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34357ACF5244E059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1360016025:0":{"text":"하하, 정말 시끌벅적하네.","source_cn":"呵呵，真是热闹啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0B8311B412982C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1360016026:0":{"text":"봄빛 축제가 정식으로 시작되었네요. 여러분, 해피 봄빛 축제!","source_cn":"春焰庆正式开始了——春焰庆快乐啊，各位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB407E7397C9346D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female